-# IVF_IDENTICAL_SCAN_ANY_DIM (now IVF_IDENTICAL_SCAN itself): lane/no-dim-idn (2026-10-04): the IDENTICAL batched scans take every
-# dimension. The old `dim <= 256` gate was the size of the shared query stage
